got it, it ended up being

00:05:08.556 --> 00:05:12.573
the single biggest decision
of my career up to this point,

00:05:12.573 --> 00:05:15.212
transitioning myself into a
media property and a brand

00:05:15.212 --> 00:05:17.185
from just being an operator on this floor.

00:05:17.185 --> 00:05:20.006
Wasn't obvious, felt like it
could have been busy work,

00:05:20.006 --> 00:05:21.666
and there's been other things
that I've done like that

00:05:21.666 --> 00:05:24.360
that have been busy work, trying
to think of a good example.

00:05:24.360 --> 00:05:27.025
